## Level and limits

This proves the prepared ObeliskChamber 0.3.2 game build loaded and initialized
all three mods on API 5, registered Trinity's panel, registered Turn Control's
list screen, reached the first frame and then ended at the configured
`--max-seconds` deadline. The run was headless, so no panel was drawn and no
save, load, turn, facility or panel interaction was performed. Quicksave
reported that it could not find the game's save folder in this headless
profile.
